WEBVTT

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:14.640
Minami?

00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:16.940
Yes?

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:21.780
The book that Chiaki wanted to read,

00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:25.220
I have it here with me, could you pass it to her?

00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:29.450
Why not come over after school?

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.310
It would make Chiaki happy.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:32.300
Is that alright?

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.010
Ok, I'll head over then.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.160
Alright.

00:00:56.540 --> 00:01:00.000
How can I get close to Fujioka-kun?

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.700
Even if you do ask me...

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:08.780
Did I ask you something?

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.950
Um... yeah.

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:23.010
Was this something from your subconscious?

00:01:23.510 --> 00:01:25.140
I see, I see.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:30.260
Fujioka Banchou and the younger sister of the first Banchou.

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:33.820
plus the addition of a regular girl to make a love triangle.

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:36.240
How beautiful is that.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.560
Erm, who are you?

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.620
Me? I am just an observer.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:43.590
Observer Hiroko.

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:48.030
I am interested in Fujioka-kun and Kana-chan so...

00:01:48.030 --> 00:01:49.800
Can you tell me the situation?

00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.230
Interest?

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:53.840
I can't believe you like Fujioka-kun too.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:58.230
Nope, he's just the subject of my observation.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:01:59.950
Have some dinner before leaving.

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:01.790
It's not good to keep imposing...

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:05.070
What? You won't accept my invitation?

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:08.290
Alright, I accept it.

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:08.510
Anyway, Fujioka-kun only has eyes for Kana.

00:02:08.510 --> 00:02:10.520
That would be great.
Anyway, Fujioka-kun only has eyes for Kana.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:11.810
Anyway, Fujioka-kun only has eyes for Kana.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:17.340
I've said too much.

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:19.620
I am just an observer.

00:02:20.170 --> 00:02:22.300
You shouldnft lose heart!

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:25.130
From what I noticed, Kana doesn't feel that way for Fujioka-kun.

00:02:25.130 --> 00:02:27.910
But Fujioka-kun has those feelings for Kana?

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:29.130
You must not give up!

00:02:29.590 --> 00:02:31.310
Until you can make your confession!

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:33.590
Th-that!

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.350
You are getting advice from someone who just recently confessed.

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:40.480
You are too weak willed.

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:43.770
Let's start by giving the other side a good impression.

00:02:49.370 --> 00:02:52.760
And so, I created a virtual Fujioka.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:57.750
What's up with you? I'm sleepy. And I was sleeping so soundly.

00:02:57.750 --> 00:03:00.050
Now let's get you to successfully confess!

00:03:00.050 --> 00:03:04.420
Give that sandbag of a Fujioka-kun a good impression.

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:08.190
Hey, Yuu.

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:13.070
To give her a good image to work with, please don't say anything funny.

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.230
Erm.

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:26.580
Um...

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.020
Um...

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:55.390
Fujioka-kun wouldn't dig his ears like that!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:58.480
He wouldn't do it!

00:03:58.840 --> 00:03:59.970
You're annoying.

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.680
What is your name again?

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.060
Riko.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.520
Riko...

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:07.180
During the real thing,

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:10.860
if you see someone doing something hateful, do you plan to retreat?

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:14.450
Fujioka only moved a little, don't use it as an excuse!

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:16.120
I see.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:20.710
The next time, no matter what virtual Fujioka does, you must not get distracted.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:22.620
Ok, practise.

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:27.250
Hey Yuu-chan, why are you here?

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:29.710
Yo Kana, long time no see!

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:32.930
I wanted to see your face, so that's why I am here.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.040
Kana is really cute.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:51.430
What's with that?

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.780
That's a really bad image.

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:59.150
That...

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.750
Yuu. Stop!

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:01.580
What?

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:03.840
It's a bad image.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:05.130
Take 2!

00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:06.750
Don't bother me anymore!

00:06:45.010 --> 00:06:50.770
I was planning to ask Keiko and Fujioka-kun to come over to study.

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:52.250
Riko, do you want to come?

00:06:53.820 --> 00:06:55.780
You can stay overnight as well.

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:57.780
Fujioka-kun is coming too right?

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.070
Yep, he's coming.

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:00.970
Fujioka-kun is coming?

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:03.410
You want me to not ask him to come ?

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:05.140
I'm coming.

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:06.120
Ok.

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.120
See you after school.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:31.610
Chiaki.

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:34.440
What should we do when everyone is over?

00:07:35.110 --> 00:07:36.570
Welcome back.

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.330
Receive them, and remember hospitality is warmth.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:40.780
and yes, I am back.

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:42.670
Welcome back.

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:46.380
Happy feelings, warmth and kindness.

00:07:46.380 --> 00:07:48.290
Does it mean warm things?

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.630
Alright!

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.500
Evening!

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:55.500
The bath seems to be ready now, guests may go first.

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:58.400
Thanks!

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:02.760
Riko, you may go first.

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:04.110
Me?

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:08.400
Fujioka-kun, you can go first then.

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.330
I'm heading back soon, so I'm good.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:16.010
Fujioka thinks to refuse the invitation, huh.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:18.680
Fujioka.

00:09:18.680 --> 00:09:19.780
Chiaki-chan.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:21.750
Thanks.

00:09:29.180 --> 00:09:32.360
This is the bathroom that Minami uses every day.

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:36.390
What am I thinking?

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:43.760
First, I bathe. It's not good to make the bath water dirty.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:47.610
I'll just take a shower.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.200
Your done, huh.

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:57.370
How was the bath? Was it warm?

00:09:57.370 --> 00:10:00.380
It was warm. Thanks.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.090
Next, please.

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:05.580
Ok.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.740
The bath that Fujioka-kun was in.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:27.990
If I were to enter that bath... but....

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:33.910
but, I think if I soak in it, I would never be able to face Fujioka-kun again.

00:10:35.410 --> 00:10:37.320
I will just shower.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:45.080
Why do I end up thinking so much?

00:10:46.810 --> 00:10:49.880
Riko, how was the bath?

00:10:50.230 --> 00:10:52.430
How was what?

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:54.550
Was the water warm enough?

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:57.560
Ah.. It was.

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.690
Has my eyesight gotten worse again?

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:15.040
I can't be like when I am at home.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.870
I am just nervous about taking a bath in other people's houses.

00:11:19.340 --> 00:11:20.990
I'll just shower.

00:11:26.980 --> 00:11:28.430
How was the bath?

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:29.380
It was good.

00:11:29.380 --> 00:11:30.670
What happened to your head?

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:32.510
It's nothing.

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:38.520
Ok, now that everyone has taken a bath, it's my turn.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:45.020
This time, I think I was a good host.

00:11:48.730 --> 00:11:52.190
Extreme warmness. Chilli Bath.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.800
Ouch!!!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:13.900
You guys!

00:12:14.720 --> 00:12:17.460
Be honest, how did you guys find the bath?

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.350
How was the bath?

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:41.930
46 points.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.710
47 points.

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:46.150
This is bad, really bad.

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:48.420
I see, well now.

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:50.380
That's great, Kana.

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:51.830
That's great.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.630
It's nothing. It's normal.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:01.390
Riko, you seem to be in high spirits.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:06.060
I think I got the highest on the test this time.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:07.750
Test?

00:13:07.750 --> 00:13:10.600
Riko, your results are normally good right?

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:13.030
It's because I have a clear goal.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:15.700
Have you decided on a school?

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.800
No, not yet.

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:23.470
If my grades are good, one day Fujioka kun will...

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.260
Hey, Riko.

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:41.260
Yes, Fujioka-kun?

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.940
What can I do to solve this?

00:13:46.420 --> 00:13:49.270
By doing this.

00:13:49.490 --> 00:13:51.230
I see!

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.690
As expected of Riko, how smart.

00:13:53.900 --> 00:13:56.790
Oh you, Fujioka-kun.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:10.100
There might be a chance to study with him alone.

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:16.900
Fujioka-kun isn't too good at studying right?

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:19.880
You have discovered my weakness...

00:14:22.680 --> 00:14:25.680
Anyway, how did you do for your test?

00:14:27.140 --> 00:14:28.660
100 points.

00:14:28.660 --> 00:14:31.940
I got 97 points.

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:38.890
Hey, Riko. How are you feeling?

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:41.050
I'm not feeling good.

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:41.700
I see.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:47.460
Speaking of the test, this time I tried a few things that Keiko suggested.

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:49.420
And I got 99 points.

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:54.240
You are good at guessing, you would be sure to win in a lottery.

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.630
Kana, tests and lotteries are two different things.

00:14:57.990 --> 00:14:59.890
Hey, Minami.

00:15:00.850 --> 00:15:02.010
Yeah?

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:08.560
The tips you gave me for this test were great, I got 98 points.

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.640
I see, Fujioka.

00:15:10.640 --> 00:15:13.560
If I bought the lottery now, I would probably win.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:15.520
Hey, Riko.

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:21.570
The 98 point person asking the 97 point person questions, is it weird?

00:15:22.530 --> 00:15:24.140
It's unusual, right?

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:31.370
Hey Keiko, on the next test tell me what to study.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.940
Please think of how to on your own.

00:15:36.130 --> 00:15:38.250
H-How can you be like that.

00:15:38.250 --> 00:15:42.460
Riko, help me, I have been abandoned by Keiko-sensei.

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.310
What, me?

00:15:44.310 --> 00:15:49.010
Fujioka, come and beg Riko sensei.

00:15:51.510 --> 00:15:53.040
Riko-sensei?

00:15:55.110 --> 00:15:58.020
Riko-sensei, I'm not very sure about this.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.820
Let me teach you.

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:05.900
It's like that.

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.790
I understand now, Riko-sensei.

00:16:13.820 --> 00:16:16.400
Fujioka-kun asking me for help with studies.

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:20.790
What should I ask for in return?

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:21.760
What's that?

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:25.730
No thanks, I'll do it myself this time round.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:28.820
What's with that serious attitude?

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:33.940
Riko, please!

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:37.060
Riko~!

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:41.920
Here and here and... here.

00:16:42.430 --> 00:16:44.200
Ah, I see.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:47.860
Ok, let's begin.

00:16:56.790 --> 00:17:00.020
Th-This is.

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:06.870
46 points 47 points,

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:09.100
This is bad, really bad.

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:10.390
This is .. this is...

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:15.150
Hey, Riko-sensei.

00:17:16.020 --> 00:17:20.280
This test, everything worked out.

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:22.310
I got 99 points.

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:22.990
Eh?

00:17:22.990 --> 00:17:25.960
You really helped.

00:17:25.960 --> 00:17:26.990
I see.

00:17:27.430 --> 00:17:29.680
What did Riko get?

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:33.350
97 points.

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:14.680
Although it may be joked about sometimes,

00:19:14.930 --> 00:19:17.530
White day is a really troublesome day.

00:19:18.030 --> 00:19:21.170
For what was funny a month ago.

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:25.590
That's not funny, it's for real.

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:27.610
I really didn't think about it.

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:31.320
You're so arrogant, it's like saying "I'm so popular."

00:19:31.820 --> 00:19:34.580
Oh yeah... Makoto is a guy.

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:38.620
I see, tomorrow is Valentine's Day.

00:19:41.860 --> 00:19:43.130
Ok.

00:19:46.510 --> 00:19:48.020
Let's play Othello.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:54.460
Kana, I thought you might say something about Valentine's day.

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:56.080
Nope.

00:19:56.080 --> 00:19:57.680
When I feel like playing Othello, I say alright.

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:02.830
Because it has nothing to do with me.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:04.690
I don't have anyone in mind.

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:08.020
And there is no one that wants to play Othello with you.

00:20:08.020 --> 00:20:09.190
Hey hey hey.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.990
Hey Chiaki, it's Othello.

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:16.660
I don't feel like playing, I always win anyway.

00:20:20.430 --> 00:20:23.830
Even if you can beat me in Othello, can you beat me in Valentine's?

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:30.000
Young people like you think too lightly of Valentine's.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.600
If something happens, you won't know what to do.

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:36.050
Aren't you the same?

00:20:36.050 --> 00:20:38.750
Experience more Valentine's!

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:42.230
If you can use it as a weapon, you will be unbeatable.

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:44.380
Is... Is that true?

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:47.750
Oh.

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.780
Ok! Let's make some hand-made chocolate.

00:20:52.310 --> 00:20:53.940
Mako-chan, you help too.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.280
Me too?

00:20:56.350 --> 00:20:57.280
Yep.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:08.920
It's done.

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:12.840
That was fast.

00:21:12.840 --> 00:21:15.790
Out of curiosity, why is Kana playing.

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:18.510
Because I wanted to play Othello.

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:24.240
I tried making chocolate with chocolate.

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:26.520
Oh, this is not bad.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:29.620
Mako-chan, try it.

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:31.570
I wonder how it is?

00:21:39.780 --> 00:21:41.530
Chiaki, that's great.

00:21:41.530 --> 00:21:44.050
This is not bad chocolate.

00:21:44.050 --> 00:21:47.290
Yep, it's good chocolate.

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:51.870
I mean is it alright if everyone ate this?

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:54.260
Isn't the primary reason to give it to someone?

00:21:56.600 --> 00:21:57.350
It's sweet!

00:21:57.350 --> 00:21:58.220
I see.
It's sweet!

00:21:58.220 --> 00:21:58.990
I see.

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:02.010
Kana just wanted to eat it herself.

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:06.680
Playing her favourite Othello, and eating her favourite sweets.

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:08.400
It really is what she wants is what she gets.

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:10.720
I have to return it someday.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:12.230
Don't say it yourself.

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:15.930
Chiaki taught me how to make these chocolates.

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:17.990
Not bad.

00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:21.800
Then Mako-chan, who are you giving them to?

00:22:21.800 --> 00:22:26.870
It's... erm... I can't say.

00:22:27.240 --> 00:22:34.700
If you aren't going to use the chocolates, let Chiaki practice giving it to people.

00:22:35.630 --> 00:22:37.010
That's fine.

00:22:37.800 --> 00:22:40.340
But, there isn't anyone I want to give them to.

00:22:40.620 --> 00:22:44.020
Anyone is fine. What you need is experience.

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.860
Anyone, huh?

00:23:02.120 --> 00:23:04.910
I wonder who Chiaki gave the chocolate to.

00:23:07.880 --> 00:23:11.630
The chocolate fell on the floor once.

00:23:14.130 --> 00:23:16.320
Chiaki saw it drop.

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:19.350
She must really not care for the person she's giving that chocolate to.

00:23:21.360 --> 00:23:22.690
Makoto.

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:27.410
Yes?

00:23:31.080 --> 00:23:33.770
Minami always uses this bath.

00:23:33.770 --> 00:23:36.360
Fujioka just soaked in this bath.

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:38.790
I can't see without my glasses

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:41.220
Next time on Minami-ke Okaeri.

00:23:41.220 --> 00:23:42.880
A warm place.

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:44.870
Somehow I feel tired.
